      "content": "exactly. it wouldn't even need to be \"malicious\" in a way that makes news, it could just be one of those \"optimization updates\" that secretly maps your stress levels through your stride. if a massive corporation wanted to build a psychological profile of an entire population without anyone realizing it, wouldnt using smart footwear be the most seamless way to do it? it's basically a walking sensor.",
